      "The player who plays with a split keyboard and round three are exactly one round apart in exit round order, in one direction or the other.",
      "Saoirse is knocked out in round three.",
      "The player who plays with the club's old mouse is earlier than the player who goes by Sparrow in exit round order.",
      "Mina is exactly one round earlier than the player who plays with a wireless headset, with no exit round in between.",
      "Saoirse is exactly one round earlier than the player who plays with an arcade stick, with no exit round in between.",
